## Overview

InsightAI is a single-file HTML + CSS analytics dashboard for visualizing company sales data (2003–2005). It includes an AI chatbot, interactive charts, role-based login, Google Sign-In UI, a multi-theme engine, a live clock, and integration hooks for three backend modules.

---

