## Authentication

### Credential Login
Three demo roles are pre-configured:

| Role | Username | Password |
|---|---|---|
| Admin | admin | admin123 |
| Analyst | analyst | analyst123 |
| User | user | user123 |

### Google Sign-In
The **"Continue with Google"** button is wired to a production-ready hook. To enable real OAuth:

1. Create a project at https://console.cloud.google.com
2. Enable the **Google Identity Services** API
3. Obtain your `client_id`
4. In `InsightAI.html`, locate the `doGoogleSignIn()` function and replace with:

```js
function doGoogleSignIn() {
  window.google.accounts.id.initialize({
    client_id: 'YOUR_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID',
    callback: handleGoogleCredential
  });
  window.google.accounts.id.prompt();
}

function handleGoogleCredential(response) {
  const decoded = parseJwt(response.credential);
  setLoggedIn({ name: decoded.name, email: decoded.email, role: 'Analyst' });
  goPage('dashboard');
}
```

5. Add the Google script tag to `<head>`:

```html
<script src="https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client" async defer></script>
```

### Sign Out
Available from three places:
- Navbar user menu (top-right avatar)
- Sidebar **"Sign Out"** item on Dashboard, Chatbot, and Reports pages
- Dropdown on the user avatar button

