## Integration Hooks

All integration points are documented with comments inside the script block.

### Data Engineering
Replace the local DS object with a fetch from your API:

```js
async function loadDataFromAPI() {
  const res = await fetch('http://data-api/sales');
  const data = await res.json();
  Object.assign(DS, data);
}
```

### NLP Engine
Replace the local getAnswer() function with an API call:

```js
async function getAnswerFromAPI(query) {
  const res = await fetch('http://nlp-api/query', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
    body: JSON.stringify({ query })
  });
  const data = await res.json();
  return data.response;
}
```

### Analytics Engine
Update KPI card values from the analytics API:

```js
async function loadKPIsFromAPI() {
  const res = await fetch('http://analytics-api/kpis');
  const kpis = await res.json();
  // Map kpis.revenue, kpis.orders, etc. to KPI card elements
}
```

